{
  "_about": "Independently written evaluation cases for the advisory triage model, run by scripts/eval_triage.py --independent. Written on the form in docs/triage-eval-protocol.md by someone other than the prompt's author, each labelled before the model ran and never relabelled to pass; converted by scripts/cases_from_form.py, which computes only what the correlator would (span, count, severity, stages) and changes no label. The same shape as triage_eval_cases.json. Access keys are one character short of the real format so that secret scanners ignore them; the account is the documentation one.",
